    "text": "Solubility of calcium phosphate (molecular mass, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></math>) in water is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></msub></math> per <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>100</mn><mo> </mo><mi>mL</mi></math> at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>25</mn><mo>°</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>.</mo></math> Its solubility product at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>25</mn><mo>°</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> will be approximately.",
